OL,3,GNEWSADiversion route is 43-mile
OL,4,A'magical mystery tour'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-mile (69km) diversion, due to
OL,7,Fovernight closures on a section of a
OL,8,Fmajor route between the M1 and M6, has
OL,9,Fbeen described as a "magical mystery
OL,10,Ftour" by the author of a UK roads
OL,11,Fwebsite.
OL,13,FThe proposed route around the closure
OL,14,Fof part of the A50 in Staffordshire was
OL,15,F"an absolute beast of a thing"
OL,16,Faccording to Chris Marshall, from
OL,17,Fwww.roads.org.uk.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
