OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSADiversion route is 43-mile
OL,4,A'magical mystery tour'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's [usually] about five miles on the
OL,7,FA50 from one end of the closure to the
OL,8,Fother, and it's going to take you about
OL,9,Fan hour's drive [during the closure] to
OL,10,Fget from one end of this to the other,
OL,11,Feven in the middle of the night."
OL,13,FNational Highways thanked drivers for
OL,14,Ftheir patience.
